margin: 0;">Hello Architects, Librarians, and Collectors:</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0;"><br></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0;">Free the shelves!  Empty the storage boxes! The mas=
sive drop of state and Federal funding is forcing libraries to make space f=
or new media.  And sadly, most architecture magazines in those bulky binder=
